OL,3,GNEWSANewly restored pier shut after
OL,4,Avandal attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pier that only reopened a week ago
OL,7,Ffollowing restoration work is shut
OL,8,Fagain due to a "significant act of
OL,9,Fvandalism".
OL,11,FThe Port of Tyne called the timing of
OL,12,FWednesday's attack, which it said had
OL,13,Fleft an estimated repair bill of about
OL,14,F#20,000, "particularly disappointing".
OL,16,FEight glass bricks in the pavement near
OL,17,Fthe lighthouse were smashed, leaving
OL,18,Fbroken glass on the ground.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
