OL,4,Avandal attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA port spokesperson said the damage had
OL,7,Fmade "the area unsafe for visitors" and
OL,8,Fleft "sensitive equipment supporting
OL,9,Fthe navigation equipment on the
OL,10,Flighthouse vulnerable".
